<title>USA: Addvantage Media extends warrant date.</title>
<headline>Addvantage Media extends warrant date.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Addvantage Media Group Inc said on Thursday it had extended to December 31 the expiration date of its 600,000 outstanding common stock purchase warrants.</p>
<p>The warrants had been set to expire on September 25, the company said.</p>
<p>Each warrant can be exercised to buy one share of common at $4, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
